* align (2) in the code between a label and a conditional on the distance from it to *: the
* translation's balignw made an alignment frag there, which gas can't size before the end, so the
* conditional failed ("non-constant expression"). After an odd dc.b the zero byte as before.
* fixed: 343bb6c 2026-10-13 r68togas: align (2) in the code without an alignment frag of its own
* expect text: 4e71 0100 0200 0003 0405 00000000 4e71
 psect align_distance,0,0,0,0,0
 nop
 dc.b 1
 align
 dc.b 2
 align
lab dc.w 3
 dc.b 4,5
 align
siz equ *-lab
 ifgt 8-siz
 rept 8-siz
 dc.b 0
 endr
 endc
 ends
